  "releaseNotes": "Behaviour change in role matching: with the And operator only the criteria a role fills (users, profiles, organization units) are combined, for inclusion and elimination alike. A role naming only profiles now reaches every holder of those profiles; before, And treated an empty criterion as not matched, so such a role reached nobody. A side that fills nothing still includes nobody and eliminates nobody. Or is unchanged. See docs/breaking-changes/role-and-filled-criteria.md.",
